        ("Service and eligibility", "ClearCV provides writing guidance, document formatting, keyword comparison, and resume exports. You must be legally able to enter an agreement in your jurisdiction or use the service with appropriate guardian permission. You are responsible for the accuracy and legality of information you enter and for reviewing every application before submission."),
